en the power of conditional mutants to analyze phage morphogenesis", "life_period": "P4", "attribution": "self"}], "rationale": "把噬菌体方法迁移到酵母"}], "local_codes": [], "rhetoric_sentence_ids": [], "doc_id": "nobel_98e5c028bbd7", "person_id": "nobel_735", "coder": "pilot:claude-in-session", "error": "", "verification": {"n_evidence": 15, "n_dropped": 0, "n_sid_fixed": 0, "n_codes_dropped": 0}}
